# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the hosted (zxvd) test suite.
#
# The CUDA driver (libcuda) allocates internal process-lifetime state on
# cuInit that it intentionally keeps until exit; every zt backend frees its
# own handles (zt_cuda_free: contexts, memory, streams, events, modules,
# both libraries). Machines with the driver installed therefore report the
# driver's caches as leaks; CI without the driver never sees them.
leak:libcuda.so
leak:libnvrtc.so